# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Raw vegeta attack dumps (binary, includes full response bodies — can get
# large fast). The human-readable *-report.txt summaries in
# docs/performance/raw/ are what's committed; regenerate the .bin locally
# with the commands in docs/performance/README.md if you need to re-derive
# a report.
docs/performance/raw/*.bin

# Kubernetes secrets filled in from infra/kubernetes/secrets.yaml.example —
# never commit the real one, only the .example template.
infra/kubernetes/secrets.yaml

# Terraform local state and plan output — see infra/terraform/README.md.
infra/terraform/.terraform/
infra/terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl
infra/terraform/*.tfstate
infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*
infra/terraform/*.tfplan
infra/terraform/environments/prod.tfvars

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
